852 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Role\072 Led end\055to\055end product design for enterprise\055scale digital experiences across web and mobile\054 working cross\055functionally with product\054 engineering\054 and design systems teams across Aeroplan\054 booking\054 and operational tools\056\nRedesigned the eUpgrades experience for Aeroplan Elite members \024 modernizing a costly legacy system and introducing educational flows to improve benefit clarity and reduce call centre dependency\056\nLed design strategy and direction for the Aeroplan Elite Status redesign \024 rethinking how hundreds of thousands of Elite members track progress\054 earn status\054 and select benefits through a gamified experience designed to drive repeated engagement and profitable behaviour\056\nDesigning an AI\055first internal tool for in\055terminal and below\055wing agents to replace fragmented communication with shared real\055time flight loading visibility \024 aimed at improving operational coordination and on\055time departures\056\nEnsured all design deliverables aligned with existing design systems\054 tokens\054 patterns\054 and layout standards to maintain consistency and streamline development\056\nIdentified opportunities for usability research and partnered with insights teams to plan and conduct testing\054 synthesizing findings into actionable design improvements\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 853 0 R
     /Pg 844 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
